profile.BALANCED=§eBalanced (Default)
profile.ULTRA=§cUltra
profile.comment=Shader profiles switch the performance-related options as a group, tuned for the best visual-to-performance ratio. §e[*]§r It's recommended to pick a profile first, then fine-tune individual settings.

option.UNDERWATER_LIGHT_SHAFTS=§eUnderwater Sun Shafts§r
option.UNDERWATER_LIGHT_SHAFTS.comment=Enables sunbeams underwater, lit through the water surface and shadow blockers. §e[*]§r Requires Shadows; independent of the Godrays in Post Processing. §c[-]§r Enabling it raises the water scene buffer to full resolution.
option.UNDERWATER_SHAFT_STRENGTH=Underwater Shaft Strength
option.UNDERWATER_SHAFT_STRENGTH.comment=Adjusts the brightness of underwater sun shafts without changing underwater fog density.
option.UNDERWATER_SHAFT_SAMPLES=§eUnderwater Shaft Detail§r
option.UNDERWATER_SHAFT_SAMPLES.comment=Determines how many shadow samples each underwater light ray takes (4-10). Higher values preserve narrower shafts at a greater GPU cost.
value.UNDERWATER_SHAFT_SAMPLES.4=Fast
value.UNDERWATER_SHAFT_SAMPLES.7=Balanced
value.UNDERWATER_SHAFT_SAMPLES.10=Fine
option.UNDERWATER_SHAFT_CALIBRATION=§eUnderwater Shaft Calibration§r
option.UNDERWATER_SHAFT_CALIBRATION.comment=Swaps the underwater shaft intensity lobe, sample distribution, and beam tint to their Solas V3.7b shapes. §c[-]§r Off in every profile; the calibration weights are a starting point pending in-game tuning.
option.END_STONE_GLOW=End Stone Glow
option.END_STONE_GLOW.comment=Bounded emission and bloom on End stone only.
option.NETHERRACK_GLOW=Netherrack Glow
option.NETHERRACK_GLOW.comment=Scales lava-adjacent rock glow; 100 keeps the previous strength.
option.DEBUG_VERTEX_AO=Vertex AO View
option.DEBUG_VERTEX_AO.comment=1 displays terrain AO directly (white=1). Requires SHADOWS.
profile.NO_SHADOWS=No Realtime Shadows
